# Optional. After receiving your licensed image, place a display-sized copy in
# public/licensed/pimlico-sheet-88.jpg (this directory is gitignored).
# Follow the licence's permitted online dimensions; standard terms cap the long edge at 1,000px.
# When unset, the sheet panel uses London Picture Archive's own public embed viewer.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ARCHIVE_IMAGE_URL=

# Optional production geocoding provider. Without a key, the small MVP uses Photon
